# CrowdSec collections for HestiaRE web protection (#186, Phase 1).
# Applied by the CrowdSec apply helper (cscli collections install), one per line,
# blank lines and # comments ignored. Scope is the nginx web tier only; ssh/ftp/mail
# stay with fail2ban (parallel). crowdsecurity/nginx already pulls base-http-scenarios
# as a dependency; it is listed explicitly so the curated set is self-documenting.
crowdsecurity/nginx
crowdsecurity/base-http-scenarios
crowdsecurity/http-cve
crowdsecurity/whitelist-good-actors
